nodes.body:
@hnyls2002, could you review the new opt-in prefill session-placement policy and shepherd it to merge once the required reviews and CI checks pass? Please enable the required `run-ci` checks for `66e61905995c`. This head includes the measured upstream baseline and its fix for the inherited lint failure.

Both four-host C24 replays retained the prefill rank for 48/48 continuation pairs. Mean TTFT fell 90.7% and aggregate output throughput rose 9.42× relative to both controls. The body also reports the lower per-request decode rate. [Hardware evidence](https://github.com/INBreezefall/sglang/tree/26bc7bdac9a4158319a7d3d8e3cd10218072bb05/benchmark/ascend_a2_pd_evidence/c24).

<!-- a2-c8-merge-review-48098-66e61905995c -->

